    "steam_appid": 3349290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/438aeaae8c06b07a114e4cbd870fd01b.poster.avif?t=1755271875\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/438aeaae8c06b07a114e4cbd870fd01b.webm?t=1755271875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/438aeaae8c06b07a114e4cbd870fd01b.mp4?t=1755271875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration action game, philosophical trip, and artistic experience. It incorporates elements of horror and roguelike. Returning is not allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/9cca300a3c390d15adef16220a99d4ab.poster.avif?t=1755271875\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/9cca300a3c390d15adef16220a99d4ab.webm?t=1755271875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/9cca300a3c390d15adef16220a99d4ab.mp4?t=1755271875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It walks you through your greatest fear and search to find meaning. It incorporates elements of horror and roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure takes place in a post-apocalyptic city occupied by mysterious creatures. The game mainly consists of exploring and feeling this bleak world's deep and strong ambience, but platforming and shooting areas will also enrich the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constructed with procedural generation, so every run is new and fresh. Not knowing in advance keeps you paying attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something unstoppable is always behind you, pressing you to continue forward and not giving you time to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most parts of the journey will require only the will to survive and move forward.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/438aeaae8c06b07a114e4cbd870fd01b.poster.avif?t=1755271875\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/438aeaae8c06b07a114e4cbd870fd01b.webm?t=1755271875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/438aeaae8c06b07a114e4cbd870fd01b.mp4?t=1755271875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration action game, philosophical trip, and artistic experience. It incorporates elements of horror and roguelike. Returning is not allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/9cca300a3c390d15adef16220a99d4ab.poster.avif?t=1755271875\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/9cca300a3c390d15adef16220a99d4ab.webm?t=1755271875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349290/extras/9cca300a3c390d15adef16220a99d4ab.mp4?t=1755271875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It walks you through your greatest fear and search to find meaning. It incorporates elements of horror and roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure takes place in a post-apocalyptic city occupied by mysterious creatures. The game mainly consists of exploring and feeling this bleak world's deep and strong ambience, but platforming and shooting areas will also enrich the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constructed with procedural generation, so every run is new and fresh. Not knowing in advance keeps you paying attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something unstoppable is always behind you, pressing you to continue forward and not giving you time to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most parts of the journey will require only the will to survive and move forward.</p>",
    "short_description": "You are in an artificial construct; you can only experience it, you can't change it. What is that tool, that allows us to build a world within the world?",
